{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc}} {{term|αυτοκρατής|tr=autokrates||one who governs alone|lang=grc}}, from {{term|αὐτός|tr=autos||single, self, same, alone|lang=grc}} + {{term|κράτος|tr=kratos||power|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|autocrac|ies}}

# A form of [[government]] in which unlimited power is held by a single [[individual]].

